   "hash": "a6aad59a57bf996f",
   "does": "Claims training load is excluded from the recovery score (Tier3 0.60/0.25/0.15); ACWR above 1.3 applies a dampened readiness penalty (ReadinessScoring.applyACWRModifier, acwrOverreachingThreshold, ReadinessScoring.swift); Load & Trajectory and the Training Load screen show the same monotony warning; AI reads TrainingMetricsCache/TrainingLoadRegistry; reports read the live cache value (HolisticDailyReport.trainingLoadForReport uses the TrainingLoadRegistry.live() snapshot and falls back to the session's frozen trainingSnapshot when no live value was captured, HolisticDailyReport.swift).",
